OL,3,GNEWSAM1 reopens after multi-vehicle    
OL,4,Acrash                                  
OL,6,FPart of the M1 in Leicestershire where 
OL,7,Ftraffic was held following a           
OL,8,Fmulti-vehicle crash has reopened.      
OL,10,FNational Highways said traffic was held
OL,11,Fon Tuesday afternoon, between junction 
OL,12,F20 and junction 21 of the M1           
OL,13,Fnorthbound.                            
OL,15,FIt later confirmed recovery was        
OL,16,Fcomplete and all lanes were open.      
OL,18,FThe transport body said there were     
OL,19,Fdelays of about 20 minutes, but added  
OL,20,Fthese were "expected to ease".         
